@baseUrl = http://localhost:5217/api/v1

### 1. Login to get token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "test-notifications-device"
}

### 2. Get my notifications (should be empty initially)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/notifications?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 3. Get unread count (should be 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 4. Mark a notification as read (replace with actual notification ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 5. Delete a notification (replace with actual notification ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 6. Mark all notifications as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/mark-all-read
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 7. Clear all notifications
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/clear-all
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 8. Get notifications without auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/notifications
